About this item
Wide range applications such as car maintenance, motorcycle maintenance, furniture assembly, home maintenance work, equipment inspection and repair, etc.;
Made from premium-quality chrome vanadium steel with a matte chrome plated finish;
Metric and SAE socket sizes combined;
Sturdy Case provides for convenient tool storage;
Includes a collection of the most popular sockets, ratchets, wrenches, bits and universal joint: (10) 1/4" Dr. Sockets, (6) 1/4" Dr. Deep Sockets, (11) 3/8" Dr. Sockets, (6) 3/8" Deep Sockets, (8) 3/8" Dr. Torx Sockets, (4) 1/2" Dr. Impact Sockets, (7) 1/2" Dr. Sockets, (6) 1/2" Deep Sockets, (4) 1/2" Dr. Sockets (SAE), (9) 3/8" Dr. Sockets (SAE), (10) 1/4" Dr. Sockets (SAE), (1) 1/4" Dr. Spinner Handle, (1) 1/4" Dr. Extension Bars, (2) 3/8" Dr. Extension Bars, (2) 1/2" Dr. Extension Bars, (2) 3/8" Dr. Spark Plug Socket, (22) 3/8" Dr. Bit Sockets, (18) 1/4" Dr. Bit, (3) Universal Joint, (3) Quick Release Ratchet Handle, (12) Spanners, (3) Double Ended Ratchet Ring Spanners.
